# Environment Configuration for AgriDOST

# 1. Google Gemini API (Server-Side Only)
# Used for AI leaf symptom analysis and crop health pathology.
# Kept strictly server-side; NEVER exposed to the browser.
# If omitted or invalid, AgriDOST falls back gracefully to its verified agronomic pre-diagnostic guides.
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# 2. Google Maps JavaScript API (Client-Side)
# Used for live satellite imagery during boundary drawing.
# If omitted, AgriDOST automatically uses its built-in interactive vector SVG cadastre.
# 100% functional without an API key or when offline!
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
